From e3ab3f3da27ccb4b5deb5a919982d87e962704ab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <3221756+christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 07:51:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] test(dsv41): align release-gate tests with 1107 series

Base: 1107 vLLM patch head efd4342f8d2a858e2183449cf88ab78803124af9 (tree 263bda12d29a602c8f37b1ec43386daef8694fb6).

Rationale:
1. test_deepseek_v41_block_scale_words.py: include _mxfp8_gemm_rope_mxfp4_decode (added by 0749) in the SFB clamped-row floor-div-32 AST check.
2. test_deepseek_v41_tilelang_iket.py: include the PDL wait phase added to gather_columns_kernel by 0753 before its single coalesced store.global range.
3. test_deepseek_v4_1_ced_model.py & test_deepseek_v4_1_ced_sp.py: initialize _ced_recovery_prompt_end on bare DeepseekV41ModelState stand-ins (0732/0734) and provide the producer MXFP8 cast and route_local contract (0720) in CED SP stand-ins.
4. test_deepseek_v4_1_engram.py: move packed_dir cleanup from test_disk_rows_read_whole_table_sources to test_disk_rows_pack_and_read_rank_compacted_files (0750).
5. test_workspace.py: stub _source_short_plan alongside _mla_plan and _index_plan when building synthetic 1-tuple TileLang attention plans (0741).

Quality: test-only; no runtime change.

Tests: all 6 files (145 passed) pass in spark-ds41f:1107 on dgx4 (GB10), bringing the 149-file release-tests gate bundle to 9,494 passed, 360 skipped, 0 failed.

Upstream status: local release-gate test alignment.
